{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library","titleHtml":"Numerics library","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric","section":"","kind":"page","summary":"The C++ numerics library includes common mathematical functions and types, as well as optimized numeric arrays and support for random number generation.","html":"<p>The C++ numerics library includes common mathematical functions and types, as well as optimized numeric arrays and support for random number generation.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"Mathematical_functions_and_types\">Mathematical functions and types</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Common_mathematical_functions\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math\">Common mathematical functions</a></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cmath\"><code>&lt;cmath&gt;</code></a> provides <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math\">standard C library mathematical functions</a> such as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/fabs\">std::fabs</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/sqrt\">std::sqrt</a></span>, and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/sin\">std::sin</a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Mathematical_special_functions\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Mathematical_special_functions_.28since_C.2B.2B17.29\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/special_functions\">Mathematical special functions</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cmath\"><code>&lt;cmath&gt;</code></a> also provides several mathematical special functions such as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/special_functions/beta\">std::beta</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/special_functions/hermite\">std::hermite</a></span>, and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/special_functions/cyl_bessel_i\">std::cyl_bessel_i</a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Mathematical_constants\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Mathematical_constants_.28since_C.2B.2B20.29\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\">Mathematical constants</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/numbers\"><code>&lt;numbers&gt;</code></a> provides several mathematical constants, such as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\">std::numbers::pi</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/constants\">std::numbers::sqrt2</a></span>\n</p><p><span id=\"Basic_linear_algebra_algorithms\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Basic_linear_algebra_algorithms_.28since_C.2B.2B26.29\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/linalg\">Basic linear algebra algorithms</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/linalg\"><code>&lt;linalg&gt;</code></a> provides basic linear algebra algorithms which are based on BLAS.\n</p><p><span id=\"Data-parallel_types\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Data-parallel_types_.28since_C.2B.2B26.29\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/simd\">Data-parallel types</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/simd\"><code>&lt;simd&gt;</code></a> provides portable types for explicitly stating data-parallelism and structuring data for more efficient SIMD access.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complex_number_arithmetic\">Complex number arithmetic</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/complex\">&lt;complex&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>complex</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  a complex number type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Numeric_arrays\">Numeric arrays</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/valarray\">&lt;valarray&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>valarray</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  numeric arrays, array masks and array slices <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"Numeric_algorithms\">Numeric algorithms</h2>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/numeric\"><code>&lt;numeric&gt;</code></a> provides numeric algorithms below:\n</p><p><span id=\"Factor_operations\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Factor_operations_.28since_C.2B.2B17.29\">Factor operations <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/numeric\">&lt;numeric&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/gcd\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>gcd</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the greatest common divisor of two integers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/lcm\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>lcm</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the least common multiple of two integers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><span id=\"Interpolation_operations\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Interpolation_operations_.28C.2B.2B20.29\">Interpolation operations <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/numeric\">&lt;numeric&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/midpoint\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>midpoint</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  midpoint between two numbers or pointers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cmath\">&lt;cmath&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/lerp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>lerp</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  linear interpolation function <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><span id=\"Saturation_arithmetic\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Saturation_arithmetic_.28since_C.2B.2B26.29\">Saturation arithmetic <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/numeric\">&lt;numeric&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/add_sat\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>add_sat</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  saturating addition operation on two integers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/sub_sat\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sub_sat</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  saturating subtraction operation on two integers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/mul_sat\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>mul_sat</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  saturating multiplication operation on two integers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/div_sat\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>div_sat</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  saturating division operation on two integers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/saturate_cast\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>saturate_cast</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an integer value clamped to the range of another integer type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Numeric_operations\">Numeric operations</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/numeric\">&lt;numeric&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/iota\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iota</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  fills a range with successive increments of the starting value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/iota\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::iota</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> fills a range with successive increments of the starting value<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(algorithm function object)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/accumulate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>accumulate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sums up or folds a range of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/reduce\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reduce</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  similar to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/accumulate\">std::accumulate</a></span>, except out of order <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/transform_reduce\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>transform_reduce</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies an invocable, then reduces out of order <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/inner_product\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>inner_product</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the inner product of two ranges of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/adjacent_difference\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>adjacent_difference</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the differences between adjacent elements in a range <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/partial_sum\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>partial_sum</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the partial sum of a range of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/inclusive_scan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>inclusive_scan</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  similar to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/partial_sum\">std::partial_sum</a></span>, includes the <span class=\"texhtml\">i</span><sup>th</sup> input element in the <span class=\"texhtml\">i</span><sup>th</sup> sum <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/exclusive_scan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>exclusive_scan</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  similar to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/partial_sum\">std::partial_sum</a></span>, excludes the <span class=\"texhtml\">i</span><sup>th</sup> input element from the <span class=\"texhtml\">i</span><sup>th</sup> sum <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/transform_inclusive_scan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>transform_inclusive_scan</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies an invocable, then calculates inclusive scan <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/transform_exclusive_scan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>transform_exclusive_scan</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies an invocable, then calculates exclusive scan <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Pseudo-random_number_generation\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random\">Pseudo-random number generation</a></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/random\"><code>&lt;random&gt;</code></a> defines <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random\">pseudo-random number generators and numerical distributions</a>. The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdlib\"><code>&lt;cstdlib&gt;</code></a> also includes C-style random number generation via <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/srand\">std::srand</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/rand\">std::rand</a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Floating-point_environment\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Floating-point_environment_.28since_C.2B.2B11.29\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv\">Floating-point environment</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cfenv\"><code>&lt;cfenv&gt;</code></a> defines <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv\">flags and functions related to exceptional floating-point state</a>, such as overflow and division by zero.\n</p><p><span id=\"Bit_manipulation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Bit_manipulation_.28since_C.2B.2B20.29\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bit\">Bit manipulation</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></h3>\n<p>The header <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/bit\"><code>&lt;bit&gt;</code></a> provides several function templates to access, manipulate, and process individual bits and bit sequences. The byte ordering (<a href=\"/w/cpp/types/endian\">endianness</a>) of scalar types can be inspected via <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/endian\"><span class=\"kw2730\">std::<span class=\"me2\">endian</span></span></a></span> facility. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric\">C documentation</a></span> for <span><span>Numerics</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"Mathematical functions and types","id":"Mathematical_functions_and_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Common mathematical functions","id":"Common_mathematical_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Mathematical special functions (since C++17)","id":"Mathematical_special_functions_.28since_C.2B.2B17.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Mathematical constants (since C++20)","id":"Mathematical_constants_.28since_C.2B.2B20.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Basic linear algebra algorithms (since C++26)","id":"Basic_linear_algebra_algorithms_.28since_C.2B.2B26.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Data-parallel types (since C++26)","id":"Data-parallel_types_.28since_C.2B.2B26.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complex number arithmetic","id":"Complex_number_arithmetic"},{"depth":3,"text":"Numeric arrays","id":"Numeric_arrays"},{"depth":2,"text":"Numeric algorithms","id":"Numeric_algorithms"},{"depth":3,"text":"Factor operations (since C++17)","id":"Factor_operations_.28since_C.2B.2B17.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Interpolation operations (C++20)","id":"Interpolation_operations_.28C.2B.2B20.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Saturation arithmetic (since C++26)","id":"Saturation_arithmetic_.28since_C.2B.2B26.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Numeric operations","id":"Numeric_operations"},{"depth":2,"text":"Miscellaneous","id":"Miscellaneous"},{"depth":3,"text":"Pseudo-random number generation","id":"Pseudo-random_number_generation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Floating-point environment (since C++11)","id":"Floating-point_environment_.28since_C.2B.2B11.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Bit manipulation (since C++20)","id":"Bit_manipulation_.28since_C.2B.2B20.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"}],"children":[{"path":"numeric/add_sat","title":"std::add_sat"},{"path":"numeric/bit_cast","title":"std::bit_cast"},{"path":"numeric/bit_ceil","title":"std::bit_ceil"},{"path":"numeric/bit_floor","title":"std::bit_floor"},{"path":"numeric/bit_width","title":"std::bit_width"},{"path":"numeric/byteswap","title":"std::byteswap"},{"path":"numeric/complex","title":"std::complex"},{"path":"numeric/constants","title":"Mathematical constants"},{"path":"numeric/countl_one","title":"std::countl_one"},{"path":"numeric/countl_zero","title":"std::countl_zero"},{"path":"numeric/countr_one","title":"std::countr_one"},{"path":"numeric/countr_zero","title":"std::countr_zero"},{"path":"numeric/div_sat","title":"std::div_sat"},{"path":"numeric/fenv","title":"Floating-point environment (since C++11)"},{"path":"numeric/gcd","title":"std::gcd"},{"path":"numeric/has_single_bit","title":"std::has_single_bit"},{"path":"numeric/lcm","title":"std::lcm"},{"path":"numeric/lerp","title":"std::lerp"},{"path":"numeric/linalg","title":"Basic linear algebra algorithms (since C++26)"},{"path":"numeric/math","title":"Common mathematical functions"},{"path":"numeric/midpoint","title":"std::midpoint"},{"path":"numeric/mul_sat","title":"std::mul_sat"},{"path":"numeric/popcount","title":"std::popcount"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"nu