ndom number generators and numerical distributions.","children":[{"label":"Pseudo-random number generation","note":"The header <random> defines pseudo-random number generators and numerical distributions."},{"label":"Floating-point environment (since C++11)","note":"The header <cfenv> defines flags and functions related to exceptional floating-point state, such as overflow and division by zero."},{"label":"Bit manipulation (since C++20)","note":"The header <bit> provides several function templates to access, manipulate, and process individual bits and bit sequences."},{"label":"See also"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17","C++20","C++23","C++26"],"wordCount":514,"codeBlockCount":0}
